    "name": "Fantasy Forest",
    "steam_appid": 3846180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/ac8b747d6606d02ec528e9e2217f6a6c.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forest isle where greenery flows, hatch and nurture phantom beasts of diverse forms. No frequent operations are needed\u2014you can witness their growth even offline. Once they transform into unique appearances, sell them for coins to unlock more rare species. From their adorable early stages to stunning evolutions, each phantom beast boasts an exclusive form, satisfying your collecting cravings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decoration System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your accumulated coins aren\u2019t just for investing in beast nurturing\u2014unlock the Decoration Workshop too! Choose from hundreds of flowers, trees, and whimsical ornaments to freely build your exclusive secret garden. Will you craft a serene moonlit grove, or a fairy-tale rainbow valley? The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Filter System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen uniquely styled filters await your free \u8c03\u914d \u2014use the magic of light and shadow to outline a dream realm that\u2019s uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wallpaper Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even set the game scenes you\u2019ve personally decorated as your desktop wallpaper\u2014let the healing landscapes stay by your side always. Whether in work breaks or moments of rest, every glance will stir your heart, as the beauty of the game and life blends harmoniously here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abundant Ambient Music &amp; White Noise:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones and instantly immerse yourself in the symphony of vivid ambient music and white noise: the soft patter of morning dew dropping on leaves, the tinkling of wind chimes kissed by the breeze...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek relaxed breeding fun or aspire to be a landscape master, &quot;Fantasy Forest&quot;<i>\u00a0</i>will whisk you away from the hustle and bustle. Write your own healing story in this tender art style. Enter this magical forest and start your wonderful journey with mystic beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/ac8b747d6606d02ec528e9e2217f6a6c.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forest isle where greenery flows, hatch and nurture phantom beasts of diverse forms. No frequent operations are needed\u2014you can witness their growth even offline. Once they transform into unique appearances, sell them for coins to unlock more rare species. From their adorable early stages to stunning evolutions, each phantom beast boasts an exclusive form, satisfying your collecting cravings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/89f75dbf6da75c72cedebcf99711a116.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decoration System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your accumulated coins aren\u2019t just for investing in beast nurturing\u2014unlock the Decoration Workshop too! Choose from hundreds of flowers, trees, and whimsical ornaments to freely build your exclusive secret garden. Will you craft a serene moonlit grove, or a fairy-tale rainbow valley? The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/a273f885fa7c09f528ab4915828a7941.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Filter System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirteen uniquely styled filters await your free \u8c03\u914d \u2014use the magic of light and shadow to outline a dream realm that\u2019s uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/d260bd3c7d14d8602719ef47e47c20c2.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wallpaper Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even set the game scenes you\u2019ve personally decorated as your desktop wallpaper\u2014let the healing landscapes stay by your side always. Whether in work breaks or moments of rest, every glance will stir your heart, as the beauty of the game and life blends harmoniously here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/84821c7a75c50fc0d4e381d7cf9caa56.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abundant Ambient Music &amp; White Noise:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones and instantly immerse yourself in the symphony of vivid ambient music and white noise: the soft patter of morning dew dropping on leaves, the tinkling of wind chimes kissed by the breeze...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.poster.avif?t=1754912044\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.webm?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846180/extras/5e01ec624da62a4ac5a21324465e1911.mp4?t=1754912044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek relaxed breeding fun or aspire to be a landscape master, &quot;Fantasy Forest&quot;<i>\u00a0</i>will whisk you away from the hustle and bustle. Write your own healing story in this tender art style. Enter this magical forest and start your wonderful journey with mystic beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the wonderful realm of \u201cFantasy Forest\u201d. Here, you\u2019ll encounter a world as clear and dreamlike as a Hayao Miyazaki anime! This is a healing game that combines creature collection, relaxed idle gameplay, and scene decoration.",
